{
  "_comment": "Golden parity fixtures for the documents skill's expansion layer — the analogue of expansion_cases.json, where the rendered artefact is the set of OUTPUT PATHS a plan produces rather than an ffmpeg argv (documents' preview returns paths). Fixed plans in, output basenames out, no model involved. Consumed by python/core/tests/test_documents_expansion_parity.py. WHY: `run` dispatches documents steps through the same loop as ffmpeg, which until 2026-08-10 executed only the first step of a plan (steps.first()). The corpus has seven multi-step documents rows, so the skill was exposed to exactly the same defect; the multi-step cases here are the regression.",
  "sandbox": "sandbox/fixtures/documents",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "single_step_compress",
      "plan": {
        "plan": [
          {
            "tool": "compress_pdf",
            "args": {
              "input": "sample.pdf",
              "compress_quality": "balanced"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected_outputs": [
        "sample-compressed.pdf"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "two_step_rotate_then_compress",
      "plan": {
        "plan": [
          {
            "tool": "rotate_pages",
            "args": {
              "input": "sample.pdf",
              "degrees": 90,
              "output": "sample_rot.pdf"
            }
          },
          {
            "tool": "compress_pdf",
            "args": {
              "input": "sample_rot.pdf",
              "compress_quality": "balanced"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected_outputs": [
        "sample_rot.pdf",
        "sample_rot-compressed.pdf"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "two_step_watermark_then_compress",
      "plan": {
        "plan": [
          {
            "tool": "watermark",
            "args": {
              "input": "sample.pdf",
              "text": "CONFIDENTIAL",
              "output": "sample_wm.pdf"
            }
          },
          {
            "tool": "compress_pdf",
            "args": {
              "input": "sample_wm.pdf",
              "compress_quality": "balanced"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected_outputs": [
        "sample_wm.pdf",
        "sample_wm-compressed.pdf"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "two_step_remove_pages_then_numbers",
      "plan": {
        "plan": [
          {
            "tool": "remove_pages",
            "args": {
              "input": "sample.pdf",
              "pages": "1",
              "output": "sample_trimmed.pdf"
            }
          },
          {
            "tool": "add_page_numbers",
            "args": {
              "input": "sample_trimmed.pdf",
              "position": "bottom-center",
              "start_at": 1
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected_outputs": [
        "sample_trimmed.pdf",
        "sample_trimmed-numbered.pdf"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
